  "identifier": "principais-duvidas-sobre-bancos-conveniados-e-pix",
  "name": "Principais Dúvidas sobre Bancos Conveniados e PIX",
  "contentFormat": "HTML",
  "contentMarkdown": "<p><strong><span style=\"color:#006400;\">BANCOS CONVENIADOS</span></strong></p>\n\n<p><br />\n001 - BANCO DO BRASIL S/A<br />\n004 - BANCO DO NORDESTE DO BRASIL S/A<br />\n033 - BANCO SANTANDER<br />\n104 - CAIXA ECONOMICA FEDERAL S/A<br />\n237 - BANCO BRASILEIRO DE DESCONTOS S/A<br />\n341 - BANCO ITAU S/A</p>\n\n<p>Obs: Esses pagamentos podem ser realizados via pix.</p>\n\n\n\n<style>\n\n.collapsing {\n  position: relative;\n  height: 0;\n  overflow: hidden;\n  transition: height 0.35s ease;\n}\n\n@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {\n  .collapsing {\n    transition: none;\n  }\n}\n\n.text-right {\n    text-align: right !important;\n}\n\n.service-section{\n    margin-top: 0rem;\n}\n.section-wrapper{\n    margin-top: 1rem;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n    border-radius: 6px;\n    padding: 1rem 1.5rem 0;\n    border: 1px solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);\n}\n.section-wrapper > p {\n    margin: 0; \n}\n\n.section-wrapper:has(sy-collapse[opened]) .open{\n    display: none;\n}\n.section-wrapper:has(sy-collapse:not([opened])) .closed{\n    display: none;\n}\n.heading{\n    cursor: pointer;\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: row;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    align-items: start;\n}\n\n.heading .open, .heading .closed{\n    font-size: 1.25rem;\n    margin-top: 4px;\n    color: hsl(0deg 0% 0%);\n}\n\n.heading p{\n    margin: 0;\n}\n\n.heading h2{\n    border: none;\n    font-weight: 500 !important;\n    font-size: 1.375rem;\n    margin: 0 1rem 1rem 0;\n    width: 95%;\n    border-bottom: 0 !important;\n}\n\n#toggleSections[data-opened=\"true\"] .closed {\n    display:none\n}\n\n#toggleSections[data-opened=\"false\"] .opened{\n    display: none;\n}\n#toggleSections{\n    cursor: pointer;\n    color: var(--primary500);\n    font-weight: 500;\n}\n\n</style>\n\n<p class=\"text-right d-print-none\">\n<a id=\"toggleSections\" data-opened=\"false\" onClick=\"handleClick()\">\n    <span class=\"closed\">Expandir todas</span>\n    <span class=\"opened\">Fechar todas</span>\n</a>\n</p>\n\n\n\n<script>\nlet collapseState = false;\n\nfunction getElements(root) {\n    return Array.from(root.querySelectorAll('*')).flatMap(item => (item.shadowRoot ? [item, ...getElements(item.shadowRoot)] : [ item ]));\n}\n\nfunction handleClick() {\n    collapseState = !collapseState;\n\n    const elements = getElements(document);\n    const toggle = elements.find(item => item.id === \"toggleSections\");\n    const collapses = elements.filter(item => item.localName === \"sy-collapse\");\n\n    toggle.setAttribute('data-opened', collapseState.toString());\n    collapses.forEach((collapse) => {\n        collapse.opened = collapseState;\n    });\n}\n</script>\n"
 }
}
